    ],
    "rows": [
      {
        "collapse": false,
        "height": "250px",
        "panels": [

        ],
        "repeat": null,
        "repeatIteration": null,
        "repeatRowId": null,
        "showTitle": false,
        "title": "Dashboard Row",
        "titleSize": "h6"
      }
    ],
    "schemaVersion": 14,
      "tags": [

    ],
    "templating": {
      "list": [

      ]
    },
    "time": {
      "from": "now-6h",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "timepicker": {},
    "timezone": "browser",
    "title": "test",
    "version": 1
  },
  "createdBy": "admin"
}
```

Status Codes:

- **200** - Ok
- **401** - Unauthorized
- **404** - Dashboard version not found
