| Action      | Scope           |
| ----------- | --------------- |
| users:write | global.users:\* |

**Example Request**:

```http
PUT /api/users/2 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

