## User

## Actual User

`GET /api/user`

**Example Request**:

```http
GET /api/user HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
```

Requires basic authentication.

**Example Response**:

```http
HTTP/1.1 200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id":1,
  "email":"admin@mygraf.com",
  "name":"Admin",
  "login":"admin",
  "theme":"light",
  "orgId":1,
  "isGrafanaAdmin":true,
  "isDisabled":false
  "isExternal": false,
  "authLabels": [],
