{{< /admonition >}}

<!-- INTERACTIVE ignore END -->

{{< docs/ignore >}}

In [Get started with Grafana Alerting: Group alert notifications](http://www.grafana.com/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/) you learn how to group alert notifications effectively.

